{"musicId":552,"duration":137.95,"vocalId":1109,"assetbundle":null,"format":"lrc","lrc":"[ti:M@GICAL☆CURE! LOVE ♥ SHOT!]\n[offset:0]\n[re:verified game recording]\n[00:10.213]Hello everyone\n[00:11.563]I'm Hatsune Miku a virtual Idol\n[00:14.764]Well that's what everyone seems to think but secretly I'm—\n[00:19.419](うりゃおいうりゃおい\n[00:20.875]oooo cyber)\n[00:21.858](Miku Miku Miku go)\n[00:24.136]I wake up to a call\n[00:25.421]Put my frilly outfit on now\n[00:27.125]It's time I open up my eyes and start the day\n[00:29.267]I combat till the dawn\n[00:30.402]Until every villain's gone wah\n[00:32.073]A clumsy trip and now I've fallen to my butt\n[00:34.132]With my magical phone\n[00:35.418]And a silly little ringtone\n[00:37.098]I'll shout a magic word and set the world in place\n[00:39.275]Whatever it may cost\n[00:40.382]There's no reason to stop\n[00:41.612]For a world that I cherish and love\n[00:43.446](TSKR)\n[00:43.830]Monsters might\n[00:44.954]Be a scary foe to fight\n[00:47.553]But I'll take the stand\n[00:49.155]If I can stop your tears and wipe them dry\n[00:51.878](I'll make you feel M@GICAL)\n[00:54.091]If my pain's a type of cure for peace I don't mind\n[00:56.485]I can play as a nurse healing you everyday\n[00:59.314]So what if I might shed a tear get some bruises?\n[01:01.782]A wipe is all I need to clean\n[01:03.087]The cherry blush away ha\n[01:04.434]Fighting through the night but I'm wide awake\n[01:06.422]It can all be so hard for me\n[01:08.028]To get through the day\n[01:09.366]Your smile is enough to heal all my aches\n[01:11.579]Wrapped in a cute bandaid\n[01:14.109]I can take the pain\n[01:15.062]Fight all day\n[01:15.712]Fill up the syringe\n[01:16.587]With love heal up the world\n[01:18.344]And go again ♥\n[01:19.759]And now its time for the moment you've been waiting for\n[01:24.382]1 2 3 ready?\n[01:28.820]Miku Miku beam\n[01:33.808]Keep going\n[01:34.592](e-e-e-e-e-e-e-)\n[01:48.484]I'm not gonna bend ha\n[01:49.447]I can be a cure for peace in your heart\n[01:51.480]And I'll play as a nurse healing you everyday\n[01:54.340]Your smile is enough to heal all my aches\n[01:56.628]All in a cute bandaid\n[01:59.103]If you're feeling pain\n[02:00.113]Call my name\n[02:00.702]I'll be by your side\n[02:01.612]Till I see your smile beam bright again ♥\n[02:04.396](うりゃおいうりゃおいoooo \n[02:05.875]oooo cyber)\n[02:06.654](Miku Miku Miku go)\n[02:10.561]あぁ 眠いよ\n","translationLrc":"[ti:M@GICAL☆CURE! LOVE ♥ SHOT!]\n[re:Project Chinese; canonical identity verified; existing line timing]\n[00:10.213]大家好呀！\n[00:11.563]我是初音未来 是一位虚拟偶像！\n[00:14.764]嘛 虽然大家似乎都是这么认为的 但暗地里我其实是——\n[00:19.419](Uryaoi!! uryaoi!! Oooo Cyber!)\n[00:21.858]（Miku Miku Miku 出发！）\n[00:24.136]被一通求救电话给吵醒\n[00:25.421]此刻穿上我那可爱的荷叶边战斗服\n[00:27.125]是时候睁开双眼 开启崭新的一天啦\n[00:29.267]我一直奋战直到破晓黎明\n[00:30.402]直到所有的恶棍通通被消灭 哇！\n[00:32.073]一个不小心笨拙地绊了一跤 摔了个屁股蹲儿\n[00:34.132]拿起我的魔法手机\n[00:35.418]伴随着那搞笑又可爱的专属铃声\n[00:37.098]只要大声喊出魔法咒语 就能让世界恢复秩序\n[00:39.275]无论需要付出怎样的代价\n[00:40.382]我都绝对没有停下脚步的理由\n[00:41.612]为了守护我所深爱与珍视的世界\n[00:43.446]（太感谢拯救啦！）\n[00:43.830]怪物们或许\n[00:44.954]会是可怕而强劲的对手\n[00:47.553]但我依然会坚定地挺身而出\n[00:49.155]只要能止住你的泪水 将它们彻底擦干\n[00:51.878]（我会让你感受到魔法的奇迹！）\n[00:54.091]若我的伤痛能成为换取和平的良药 我一点也不在乎\n[00:56.485]我愿意化身小护士 每一天都为你疗愈伤口\n[00:59.314]就算可能会落下一两滴眼泪、受点淤青擦伤又算得了什么呢？\n[01:01.782]只需轻轻一擦 就能抹去脸颊上泛红的羞涩 哈！\n[01:04.434]彻夜激战但我依然精神饱满\n[01:06.422]尽管有时度过艰难的一天会如此疲惫\n[01:09.366]但只要看到你的微笑 就足以治愈我所有的酸痛\n[01:11.579]贴上一枚可爱的创口贴\n[01:14.109]我就能咬牙承受所有痛苦\n[01:15.062]奋战一整天\n[01:15.712]将针筒装满治愈的药剂\n[01:16.587]用满满的爱意治愈整个世界\n[01:18.344]然后再次勇往直前\n[01:19.759]那么现在 终于到了大家期待已久的时刻啦！\n[01:24.382]1！ 2！ 3！ 准备好了吗？\n[01:28.820]MIKU MIKU 光线————！\n[01:33.808]继续加油！\n[01:34.592](E-e-ee-e-e-e-)\n[01:48.484]我绝不会屈服退缩！ 哈！\n[01:49.447]我能够成为拂平你内心创伤的治愈良药\n[01:51.480]我会化身小护士 每一天都为你送上治愈\n[01:54.340]但只要看到你的微笑 就足以治愈我所有的酸痛\n[01:56.628]全都包裹在可爱的创口贴之中\n[01:59.103]若是你感到难过与痛苦\n[02:00.113]就大声呼唤我的名字吧\n[02:00.702]我定会飞奔到你的身旁\n[02:01.612]直到再次看见你绽放出灿烂光芒的笑颜\n[02:04.396](Uryaoi!! uryaoi!! Oooo Cyber!)\n[02:06.654]（Miku Miku Miku 出发！）\n[0